}

docs {
  # Post Create Reminder

  This request is used to create a reminder by using given `vehicle_id`, `reminder_title`, `reminder_context`, `reminder_body`, `reminder_location`, `reminder_image`, and `reminder_at`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, firebase storage, google calendar API, has a protected routes, and audited activity (history).

  ## Request Body (multipart/form-data)

  | Field              | Type   | Required | Description                        |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------|
  | vehicle_id          | string | yes      | Vehicle ID                          |
  | reminder_title      | string | yes      | Reminder title                       |
  | reminder_context    | string | yes      | Reminder context (e.g. Service)      |
  | reminder_body       | string | yes      | Reminder body text                   |
  | reminder_location   | string | no       | Coordinates (lat, long)             |
  | reminder_image      | file   | no       | Reminder image (binary)              |
  | remind_at           | string | yes      | Reminder date/time                   |

  ## Responses

  **201 — reminder created**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "reminder created"
  }
```

  **400 — reminder failed to validated**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "[failed validation message]"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}